infinite-patch 1
# Psytrance Acid Squelch Lead Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 62
  i note1 62
  i note2 62
  i note3 62
  i note4 62
  i note5 62
  i note6 62
  i note7 74
  i note8 62
  i note9 62
  i note10 62
  i note11 62
  i note12 62
  i note13 62
  i note14 65
